<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>PayloadType</key>
    <string>Configuration</string>
    <key>PayloadVersion</key>
    <integer>1</integer>
    <key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
    <string>io.github.veildns.dns.google</string>
    <key>PayloadUUID</key>
    <string>77CFC446-D2F0-4B4F-AB46-43E6799FA85B</string>
    <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
    <string>VeilDNS - Google DNS over HTTPS</string>
    <key>PayloadDescription</key>
    <string>선택 설치용 macOS 시스템 DNS 설정. 시스템 resolver의 모든 도메인 질의를 Google HTTPS DNS로 처리하도록 구성합니다. VeilDNS 앱을 종료해도 유지됩니다. 해제하려면 시스템 설정에서 이 프로파일을 제거하세요. SNI 분할, VPN, 인증서 또는 기기 관리 등록은 포함하지 않습니다.</string>
    <key>PayloadOrganization</key>
    <string>VeilDNS Open Source</string>
    <key>PayloadScope</key>
    <string>System</string>
    <key>PayloadRemovalDisallowed</key>
    <false/>
    <key>PayloadContent</key>
    <array>
        <dict>
            <key>PayloadType</key>
            <string>com.apple.dnsSettings.managed</string>
            <key>PayloadVersion</key>
            <integer>1</integer>
            <key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
            <string>io.github.veildns.dns.google.settings</string>
            <key>PayloadUUID</key>
            <string>B7F0C772-A5CD-4381-8DE0-622A230F6301</string>
            <key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
            <string>Google DNS over HTTPS</string>
            <key>DNSSettings</key>
            <dict>
                <key>DNSProtocol</key>
                <string>HTTPS</string>
                <key>ServerURL</key>
                <string>https://dns.google/dns-query</string>
                <key>ServerAddresses</key>
                <array>
                    <string>8.8.8.8</string>
                    <string>8.8.4.4</string>
                    <string>2001:4860:4860::8888</string>
                    <string>2001:4860:4860::8844</string>
                </array>
            </dict>
            <key>OnDemandRules</key>
            <array>
                <dict>
                    <key>Action</key>
                    <string>Connect</string>
                </dict>
            </array>
        </dict>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
